    <div class="blog-article__feature">
      <img src="/assets/images/blog/offset-account-vs-redraw-australia-feature.jpg" alt="Offset account vs redraw Australia — key differences, interest savings, flexible access and which feature saves more" width="1200" height="630" loading="eager">
